---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Methodology">
  <h1>Methodology</h1>
  <p>Facts are stored as short, scoped claims with sources and a review date. Security properties are never a single yes/no: each is <em>supported</em>, <em>not supported</em>, <em>conditional</em> (with stated conditions), <em>unknown</em> or <em>not applicable</em>. Unknown is never shown as "no".</p>
  <p>Comparisons are between concrete deployment profiles (for example "password plus TOTP"), not between brand names or abstract categories. There is no overall security score.</p>
  <p>Every change is reviewed before publication and recorded in public version history.</p>
</Base>
